												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <h1><span>关注人士档案#02222/01 — &quot;Aethris&quot;</span></h1> <p><strong>真实姓名：</strong>███████ ████</p> <p><strong>已知假名：</strong>Aethris，Aethris_Art，Aestrei</p> <p><strong>关注原因：</strong>该关注人士拥有可观数量的模因艺术作品收藏，但并未与当前已知的任何异常艺术相关组织有联系。可能是III类本质促动实体。</p> <p><strong>描述：</strong>Aethris（在社交媒体平台Reddit和推特上分别以Aestrei和Aethris_Art的身份出现）是一名业余异常艺术生产者，拥有各种不同艺术风格，从数字绘画到像素艺术不等。</p> <h2><span>作品集：</span></h2> <div id="wiki-tabview-ea10421b785195cc94a306ff8a5480ec" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>数字艺术</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>标志与印记</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>像素艺术</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>涂鸦</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-001&nbsp;S.D.&nbsp;Locke的提案&nbsp;-&nbsp;破晓之时</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏&nbsp;破晓之时</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://i.loli.net/2020/11/25/dleTNFLmRDqfi19.png" alt="dleTNFLmRDqfi19.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-093&nbsp;-&nbsp;红海物件</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏&nbsp;SCP-093</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://i.loli.net/2020/11/25/zc75g62nA4irOpL.png" alt="zc75g62nA4irOpL.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-963&nbsp;-&nbsp;